    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a patch with Gaussian-shaped influence. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="class_gaussian_patch" kindref="compound">GaussianPatch</ref> class is a concrete implementation of <ref refid="class_patch_shape" kindref="compound">PatchShape</ref>. The influence zone follows a Gaussian distribution centered on the patch, allowing partial coverage of landscape cells depending on distance from the center. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
